Intro 
In this project we use a distant sensor this will set off the Piezo, also we have the Photoresistor to automatically turn on at night. 

Requirement Analysis
It needs to light up when the wheel stops, so the LED turns on, also it will help to alert others that there’s someone near them. 
We have to test it on a wheel to know if the magnets can detect when the bike it’s stopped.
Some things that will make it harder to finish:
